G: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 추가</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모집 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선착순 1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">0</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">우리학교 학부 재학생 및 창업동아리 팀원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응용수학과 학생은 제외</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">캠프내용 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업전문가 초청 강연</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">실전창업에 대한 전문가 멘토 지원을 통한 사업계획서 작성 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Skill </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">향상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">우수발표사례</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업에 관심 있는 학생들 간의 교류 및 만남의 장 마련 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가학생 혜택 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">해외신기술견학 관련&nbsp;LINC&nbsp;마일리지 지급 예정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사업계획서 우수자 발표자 시상금 지급</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">팀</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가자 전원 총장명의 창업캠프 수료증 지급 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가비 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">무료</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">박 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일간 숙식 무료 제공</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장 소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호텔 금오산</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">구미</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padd